# Middleman needs NO secrets to run.
# The judged path — python3 scripts/middleman.py, the deployed page, the paste box and the
# /api/swaps proxy — uses CoinMarketCap's keyless /public-api surface. Nothing reads this file.

# ── CoinMarketCap (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get from: https://coinmarketcap.com/api  (free Basic plan; the key is never required)
# An escape hatch for a reader whose IP the anonymous tier has throttled: exported in the
# shell, it moves the identical calls to the keyed host. Never read from disk, never printed;
# a keyed run announces itself on its first line and in its receipt, and scripts/seed.py
# refuses to record one. Leave it unset to reproduce every receipt in this repository.
# CMC_API_KEY=your-key-here
